{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Tiny Garden&quot; is a soothing desktop idle game that quietly grows in the corner of your screen while you work or study. Freely arrange your plants anywhere on screen - they'll never interrupt your productivity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet your quirky plant babies! From shy little sprouts to chatty humanoid blossoms, your Tiny Island blooms with personality. Each adorable plant grows with its own unique charm!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/3\u670827\u65e5__1_.gif?t=1743497792\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every mystery plant box brings a new surprise!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/3\u670827\u65e5__1__4_.gif?t=1743497792\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover a world of surprises with our decorative mystery boxes!</strong> Plus, enjoy soothing background music to accompany your work and study sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/3\u670828\u65e5__1__3_.gif?t=1743497792\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/3\u670828\u65e5__1__1_.gif?t=1743497792\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575790?t=1743497792","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575790?t=1743497792","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/5aaa2b5f